Description:
    beFAIR provides an ETL (Extract-Transform-Load) framework for
    clinical research platforms. It creates and manages structured
    'FAIRground' project directories, enforces codebook-driven data
    schemas in a SQL database, and automates the drafting, running,
    and tracking of ETL scripts. Designed to harmonize data across
    clinical studies using standardized codebooks, beFAIR supports
    reproducible data ingestion and promotes FAIR (Findable,
    Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable) data practices.
